From: canoziia <canoziia@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mimo26: one profile switch for the MiMo series

VLLM_MIMO26_OPT_PROFILE=default sets the deployed value of every switch of
the series (0002 MTP3 parallel heads, DeepSeek 0003 fast deterministic MoE
align, 0004 sort align, 0005 fp8 MTP draft head, 0007 adaptive draft widths,
0008 deferred PP feedback receive, 0009 MXFP4 MoE decode v2 with DQ2, 0010 prefill attention BLOCK_M 128 + qk split) unless that variable is already set.
---

